    "detailed_description": "&quot;Don't! Fret&quot; is a first person psychological mascot-horror puzzle game, where music and horror intertwine in ways never before seen by the indie gaming community. Navigate the hallways of Harmonic Heights as &quot;Fret,&quot; a young talented guitar who is in search of finding a way back home. <br><br><strong>MEET FRET<strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/c2e86576d2557d4ea0e0a8f6b1bbf519.poster.avif?t=1731729177\" width=506 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/c2e86576d2557d4ea0e0a8f6b1bbf519.webm?t=1731729177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/c2e86576d2557d4ea0e0a8f6b1bbf519.mp4?t=1731729177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Step into the shoes of Fret, a prodigious musical student, and embark on a mind-bending journey with perplexing puzzles that gradually unveil the horrific tales within the walls.<br><br><strong>STYLIZED VISUALS</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/45287b009b2d1a7226453b9083d4f0f6.poster.avif?t=1731729177\" width=506 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/45287b009b2d1a7226453b9083d4f0f6.webm?t=1731729177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/45287b009b2d1a7226453b9083d4f0f6.mp4?t=1731729177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With stylized art, unparalleled sound design and nightmarish creatures, Don't! Fret creates an completely unique horror gaming experience.<br><br><strong>RUN AND HIDE</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/526c65f4f246690a1bffb54716343bb1.poster.avif?t=1731729177\" width=506 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/526c65f4f246690a1bffb54716343bb1.webm?t=1731729177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/526c65f4f246690a1bffb54716343bb1.mp4?t=1731729177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Don't! Fret offers a distinctive horror gameplay experience. You'll find yourself in a relentless pursuit, running and concealing yourself from the malevolent forces prowling through the ominous halls. Brace yourself for an adrenaline-pumping adventure like no other.<br><br><strong>EXPLORE THE NIGHTMARE</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/acec25965d7fb15a1e4142f80211a141.poster.avif?t=1731729177\" width=506 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/acec25965d7fb15a1e4142f80211a141.webm?t=1731729177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/acec25965d7fb15a1e4142f80211a141.mp4?t=1731729177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Delve into the mysteries concealed within the confines of Don't! Fret, but proceed with caution\u2014what lurks within those walls may be more than meets the eye. Approach with care, for danger may be closer than you think.<br><br><strong>DON'T! BE FOOLED</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/73a75c1a7b30b05cbfdecb01cc8e1fbd.poster.avif?t=1731729177\" width=506 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/73a75c1a7b30b05cbfdecb01cc8e1fbd.webm?t=1731729177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/73a75c1a7b30b05cbfdecb01cc8e1fbd.mp4?t=1731729177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>To the naked eye, the musical world of Don't! Fret might be charming. As you dive deeper into the horrific tale, you will sink a psychological nightmare with horrific scenes and set pieces.<br><br><br><strong>ROCKIT MUSIC</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/08e432157ffa94c8c15358f8e443688e.avif?t=1731729177\" width=506 height=264 /></span><br>The world of Don't! Fret, and the music is created by Rockit of Rockit Music. As pioneers in the Nerdcore music genre, they stand at the forefront, boasting an impressive record of over 400 million views and a thriving community of over 1 million subscribers on YouTube. Their expertise lies in crafting immersive soundscapes inspired by indie horror and pop culture, ensuring an electrifying auditory experience for enthusiasts and casual listeners alike.<br><br>Don't! Fret is truly one-of-a-kind adventure that you can't miss!</strong></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Don't! Fret&quot; is a first person psychological mascot-horror puzzle game, where music and horror intertwine in ways never before seen by the indie gaming community. Navigate the hallways of Harmonic Heights as &quot;Fret,&quot; a young talented guitar who is in search of finding a way back home. <br><br><strong>MEET FRET<strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/c2e86576d2557d4ea0e0a8f6b1bbf519.poster.avif?t=1731729177\" width=506 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/c2e86576d2557d4ea0e0a8f6b1bbf519.webm?t=1731729177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/c2e86576d2557d4ea0e0a8f6b1bbf519.mp4?t=1731729177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Step into the shoes of Fret, a prodigious musical student, and embark on a mind-bending journey with perplexing puzzles that gradually unveil the horrific tales within the walls.<br><br><strong>STYLIZED VISUALS</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/45287b009b2d1a7226453b9083d4f0f6.poster.avif?t=1731729177\" width=506 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/45287b009b2d1a7226453b9083d4f0f6.webm?t=1731729177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/45287b009b2d1a7226453b9083d4f0f6.mp4?t=1731729177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With stylized art, unparalleled sound design and nightmarish creatures, Don't! Fret creates an completely unique horror gaming experience.<br><br><strong>RUN AND HID