    "pc_requirements": {
        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700K | AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 1060 8GB or Radeon RX 580 8GB or Arc A380.<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Meeting the minimum requirements will allow the game to run at Low to Medium settings in Full HD (1080p) with a stable 30 FPS. For an optimal experience, we recommend using an SSD for faster load times and smoother gameplay. Please note that during certain cutscenes, performance may be impacted if the CPU usage is high, which could result in rendering issues.</li></ul>",
        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700K | AMD Ryzen 5 3600X<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae 2080RTX or AMD Radeon\u2122 6800XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> With the recommended requirements, the game is expected to run at Medium settings or High settings in Full HD (1080p) with a smooth 60 FPS. For the best experience, we recommend using an SSD to ensure faster load times and optimal performance.</li></ul>"
    },
